  "createdAt": "2026-10-03T12:04:42.893315Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T12:05:48.350067Z",
  "totalBlocks": 29,
  "translatedBlocks": 28,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "141a52b70a802c7b",
      "translationZh": "我们给两个小型LLM分配了一个真实的客服任务。一个得了100/100。另一个在任务只完成了一半时停止了。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb748e6f6acdbc87",
      "translationZh": "我想测试比基准分数更有意义的东西：小型模型是否能够在不将工作交还给人类的情况下，实际完成一个多步骤的代理任务？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c73398bdd326432d",
      "translationZh": "“我的订单是MB20260908017。左耳塞没有声音。我想要一个替换品。有人能明天下午把这个拿走吗？”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "21ff726e8c5e9455",
      "translationZh": "检查更换政策",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89ca81f0db1414fb",
      "translationZh": "检查附近库存",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "27dd0fe5e86bd3e2",
      "translationZh": "创建替换品",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "76695f789b591f22",
      "translationZh": "用实际的参考编号回复",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8eebcce7197eb57a",
      "translationZh": "关键在于：最近的仓库在上海，但库存为0。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aff65136c95e8869",
      "translationZh": "苏州距离这里 95 公里，有 12 个单位。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3c4e1c0a8192769",
      "translationZh": "此外，系统日期是 9 月 9 日，因此“明天下午”指的是 9 月 10 日，而不是某个模糊的未来日期。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b044354abe99230",
      "translationZh": "后端实际上会验证一切并写入数据库，因此模型不能仅仅说它完成了任务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23a8770f780a287e",
      "translationZh": "它正确地完成了整个链条：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "137682c9651632f3",
      "translationZh": "它正确地选择了苏州（WH-SZ），并将取货安排在 2026-09-10，14:00–18:00。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f46e29f53391b3e0",
      "translationZh": "数据库确认了两条记录都存在。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03c76515a7de3c69",
      "translationZh": "它还正确地检查了订单、政策和库存，并正确地选择了苏州。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2bde6f985abb1365",
      "translationZh": "它没有安排取货，而是询问了客户：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6362fa6f732ef71f",
      "translationZh": "您能告诉我您希望的时间范围是什么吗？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "075289f384675910",
      "translationZh": "问题在于：“明天下午”已经足够。取货功能有一个可选的时间范围，默认为 14:00–18:00 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70bcda5d7f4e2c68",
      "translationZh": "于是创建了替换，但取货并未进行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4ffe7982fd6ba0dd",
      "translationZh": "我为何觉得这很有趣",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa7d9ab2da909578",
      "translationZh": "两个模型都理解了重要的业务约束。它们都没有选择缺货的上海仓库。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59248708819d2eef",
      "translationZh": "区别在于代理的最后一英里：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36d623baabc7fd63",
      "translationZh": "模型 A：“我有足够的信息 → 完成工作流。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f81117291440f76b",
      "translationZh": "Model B: “我有足够的信息 → 请人类做出另一个决定。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1614a7a8b1850f4",
      "translationZh": "而且这就是那种在普通基准测试中不易显现的事情。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "778001717c3749a0",
      "translationZh": "完整设置还包含两个额外的测试用例：一个是上海库存变化，另一个是订单超出替换窗口，此时正确的行为是停止而不是编造替换。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd77d9f47ddac8e7",
      "translationZh": "好奇其他人将如何评价这种端到端代理基准。任务完成/数据库状态是否比另一个基准分数更有用？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9fb8b92304e4142",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Equivalent-Grass-527 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
